--- DB proof: no order persisted for this attempt (backend's own OrderPlacementService gate caught it, frontend gate did not) ---
Backend returned http_status=203 with message key messages.amount_crossed_maximum_cod_order_amount
(Admin/app/Services/Order/OrderPlacementService.php:599-600) -- a SEPARATE, pre-existing
final-placement COD-cap gate, unrelated to NEARS-2345/NEARS-3392, which discloses the
EXISTENCE of a cod cap (not its value) via UI text "Amount crossed maximum cod order amount".
This is what actually stopped the bad order from landing -- the FRONTEND gate
(isDeliveryQuotePending/isDeliveryQuoteFailed) had already failed to do its job.
